<title>LEBANON: Lebanon has $221.2 mln BoP surplus in November.</title>
<headline>Lebanon has $221.2 mln BoP surplus in November.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon had a $221.2 million balance of payments surplus in November, $80.1 million up on October, the Bank of Lebanon said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>    BALANCE OF PAYMENTS	 Nov 96	Oct 96	Nov 95</p>
<p>    Monthly			 221.2	  141.1	  64.0</p>
<p>    Year to date		  684.6	  463.4	 147.0</p>
<p>Annual results</p>
<p>    1995	 256</p>
<p>    1994     1,130.5</p>
<p>    1993     1,169.5</p>
<p>Note - Figures in millions of U.S. dollars, balance is in surplus unless indicated by minus sign.</p>
<p>- Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 602057 353078 861723</p>
